<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Lolwut</p>
<p>Well i didn’t see that coming. Weird mixture of meta here. I’m not a gigantic fan overall, but it’s pretty clear that something’s underneath it all and knows enough about the Foundation to know D-Class exists, as well as being able to get into systems for the hypnotic/memetic effect. The creativity of the force implies that it’s not really sapient as we know it, I like that.</p>
<p>It reminds me vaguely of my own <a href="/scp-789">SCP-789</a>, a really specialized ‘predator’. But of course, they're not at all related, at least how I understand 789 and this to work.</p>
<p>Interesting interpretation of monthly termination though. All I can see it as is <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=phFgCLguSNI">this video</a> but upwards. A+</p>
